# R11 hygiene (prompt-4): the six never-committed paths — machine-local state,
# session tool artifacts, and the sandbox's runtime scripts. The canonical
# values live in .env.example; local .env stays on disk (gitignored).
.env
db/
.zscripts/
agent-ctx/
tool-results/
download/
